                <div class="toolkit-agent-sub" id="toolkitPdfSub">pdf-inspector · conversión local (WASM)</div>
                <button type="button" class="toolkit-agent-close" id="toolkitPdfCloseBtn" title="Cerrar">Cerrar</button>
            </div>
